I will redact sensitive information and move them to environment variables to comply with GitHub's repository rules:

1.  **Modify [services/firebaseService.ts](file:///e:/TDC_App/TDGAMES_App/td-games-invoice-app/services/firebaseService.ts)**: Replace the hardcoded Firebase config with environment variables (`import.meta.env`).
